- Fixed preflight version-pin parsing that caused a false Kind mismatch in cycles logs. The previous awk in scripts/lib/preflight.sh:preflight::yaml_value() intermittently failed to extract pinned values from versions.lock.yaml, leading to errors like “kind version v0.22.0 != pinned kind: …” even when correct.
