Changes I made this pass
1) Add a CI “soft mode” to preflight tool-version checks
- scripts/lib/preflight.sh: preflight::tool_versions now respects AINETOPS_SOFT_TOOLCHECK=true to WARN instead of die when tools are missing or version mismatched. This allows CI/minimal environments to produce logs and continue the cycles while still emitting visibility into pin drift.
