- tests/integration/cycles_runner.sh: export AINETOPS_SOFT_TOOLCHECK=true for each provision invocation so cycles produce the provision/test/off logs instead of aborting at preflight.
- Proof slice:
  - .wiggum/features/001-ainetops-sonic-evpn-fabric/gates/proofs/tests.integration.cycles_runner.sh.soft-toolcheck.slice.txt (shows env var on the provision call)

